msgid "Check in equipment\\n"
msgstr "Facturar el equipo\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_007"
msgid "Subvert security monitoring system\\n"
msgstr "Burlar al sistema monitor de seguridad\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_008"
msgid "Obtain flight plans from safe\\n"
msgstr "Obtener planes v. de la caja fuerte\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_009"
msgid "Board Air Force One\\n"
msgstr "Abordar el Air Force One\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_010"
msgid "Obtain suitcase.\\n"
msgstr "Obtén la maleta.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_011"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_012"
msgid "Suitcase\\n"
msgstr "Maleta\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_013"
msgid "Suitcase\\n"
msgstr "Maleta\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_014"
msgid "Picked up a suitcase.\\n"
msgstr "Maleta obtenida.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_015"
msgid "Obtain air stewardess uniform.\\n"
msgstr "Obtén el uniforme de azafata de vuelo.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_016"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_017"
msgid "Disguise\\n"
msgstr "Disfraz\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_018"
msgid "Disguise\\n"
msgstr "Disfraz\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_019"
msgid "Picked up a stewardess uniform.\\n"
msgstr "Uniforme de azafata obtenido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_020"
msgid "Obtain flight plans from safe.\\n"
msgstr "Obtén los planes de vuelo de la caja fuerte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_021"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_022"
msgid "Flight Plans\\n"
msgstr "Planes de Vuelo\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_023"
msgid "Flight Plans\\n"
msgstr "Planes de Vuelo\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_024"
msgid "Picked up the flight plans.\\n"
msgstr "Planes de vuelo obtenidos.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_025"
msgid "Look out - it's an intruder...\\n"
msgstr "Cuidado. Es un intruso...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_026"
msgid "Innocent civilians have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Han muerto civiles inocentes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_027"
msgid "Is he OK?\\n"
msgstr "¿Está bien?\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_028"
msgid "I'll go and get some help.\\n"
msgstr "Iré para obtener alguna ayuda.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_029"
msgid "Good afternoon.\\n"
msgstr "Buenas tardes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_030"
msgid "OK, you know the way from here.\\n"
msgstr "Muy bien, ya conoce el camino desde aquí.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_031"
msgid "You'll have to check that weapon in here.\\n"
msgstr "Deberás dejar ese arma aquí.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_032"
msgid "Oh, my God!\\n"
msgstr "¡Oh, Dios mío!\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_033"
msgid "Weapons are not allowed in the base.\\n"
msgstr "No se permiten armas en la base.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_034"
msgid "Right, I'm calling security.\\n"
msgstr "De acuerdo, avisaré a seguridad.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_035"
msgid "System shutdown initiated...\\n"
msgstr "Cierre del sistema iniciado...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_036"
msgid "Security systems have been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "Los sistemas de seguridad han sido apagados.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_037"
msgid "Weapons have been detected.\\n"
msgstr "Se han detectado armas.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_038"
msgid "Suitcase has been deposited.\\n"
msgstr "La maleta ha sido facturada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_039"
msgid "Suitcase has been scanned.\\n"
msgstr "La maleta ha sido escaneada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_040"
msgid "Hey, you - this is a restricted area.\\n"
msgstr "Hey, tú: ésta es un área restringida.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_041"
msgid "Are you new around here?\\n"
msgstr "¿Eres nueva por aquí?\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_042"
msgid "Hey - give me back my case.\\n"
msgstr "Hey. Devuélveme mi maleta.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_043"
msgid "You get security - I'll deal with her...\\n"
msgstr "Trae a seguridad, yo me encargo de ella...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_044"
msgid "Upstairs...there's an intruder.\\n"
msgstr "Arriba... hay un intruso.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_045"
msgid "Laser grid access denied.\\n"
msgstr "Acceso a la rejilla de láser denegado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_046"
msgid "Laser grid system has been overloaded.\\n"
msgstr "Sistema de rejilla de láser sobrecargado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_047"
msgid "Too many neutral casualties inflicted.\\n"
msgstr "Demasiados civiles heridos.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_048"
msgid "Stop them from getting the safe...\\n"
msgstr "Detenles antes de que abran la caja fuerte...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_049"
msgid "Disguise worn.\\n"
msgstr "Disfraz puesto.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_050"
msgid "Now's your chance! Grab the stewardess's \\nbag and get her uniform.\\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Ésta es tu oportunidad! Agarra la bolsa \\nde la azafata y coge su "
"uniforme.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_051"
msgid "Use that case to conceal your equipment.\\n"
msgstr "Usa la maleta para ocultar tu equipo.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_052"
msgid "The case will get stopped unless you do something.\\n"
msgstr "La maleta será detenida a menos que hagas algo.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_053"
msgid "So that's Air Force One? ... Huh, smaller \\nthan I thought.\\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Así que ese es el Air Force One? ... Huh, es más \\npequeño de lo que "
"pensaba.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_054"
msgid "Stop them - they're breaking into the safe...\\n"
msgstr "Detenlos: están accediendo a la caja fuerte...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_055"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark in position. I can see the main entrance to the base, and I can "
"just make out the cable car arrival point.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Agente Dark en posición. Puedo ver la entrada principal de la base, y "
"distingo el punto de llegada del teleférico.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_056"
msgid ""
"Excellent, Joanna. That cable car is your way in... Our observer at the "
"lower terminus has spotted a member of the flight crew boarding a minute "
"ago. She is being escorted by air base troops. I don't have to remind you "
"that...\\n"
msgstr ""
"Excelente, Joanna. Ese teleférico es tu modo de entrar... nuestro observador"
" de la terminal inferior ha visto a un miembro de la tripulación entrar hace"
" un minuto. Está siendo escoltada por tropas de la base aérea. No debo "
"recordarte que probablemente...\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_057"
msgid ""
"That they're probably innocent of any involvement in Trent's little scheme. "
"And I can't shoot them even if they shoot at me. What about the NSA "
"Agents?\\n"
msgstr ""
"Que probablemente sean inocentes de estar involucrados en la pequeña trama "
"de Trent. Y que no puedo dispararles aunque ellos me disparen a mí. ¿Qué "
"pasa con los agentes de la ANS?\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_058"
msgid ""
"I don't know how far the conspiracy has spread through the NSA, but I'm "
"willing to bet that the men Trent has around him here are loyal to him and "
"his plan. You have to get the evidence of Trent's betrayal onto Air Force "
"One and show it to the President.\\n"
msgstr ""
"No sé cuán lejos ha llegado la conspiración a través de la ANS, pero podría "
"apostar a que los hombres que Trent ha situado por aquí son leales a su plan"
" y a él mismo. Debes encontrar evidencias de la traición de Trent en el Air "
"Force One y enseñárselas al Presidente.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_059"
msgid ""
"Yes, and protect him from his abductors. Do you have any idea what Trent's "
"plan might be yet, and what about those blonde guys?\\n"
msgstr ""
"Sí, y protegerle de sus secuestradores. ¿Tienes alguna idea sobre de qué "
"puede tratar el plan de Trent, y qué pasa con esos chicos rubios?\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_060"
msgid ""
"Only vague suspicions, and I won't distract you with those. Good luck. "
"Carrington out.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Sólo sospechas vagas, y no quiero distraerte ahora con eso. Buena suerte. "
"Carrington fuera.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_061"
msgid "Lift inoperative - security system is active.\\n"
msgstr "Ascensor no operativo: sistema de seguridad activo.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_062"
msgid "Critical mission personnel disabled.\\n"
msgstr "Personal crítico de la misión eliminado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_063"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_064"
msgid "Entrance to base secured.\\n"
msgstr "Entrada a la base asegurada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_065"
msgid "We're taking over!!\\n"
msgstr "¡¡Nos ocupamos nosotros!!\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_066"
msgid "Hover trolley has been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "El teleférico ha sido derribado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_CAVE_067"
msgid "Equipment cannot be checked in.\\n"
msgstr "El equipo no puede ser registrado.\\n"
